OL,3,GNEWSATrump to arrive in Ireland for
OL,4,Atwo-day visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump will arrive
OL,7,Fon Saturday morning at Dublin Airport
OL,8,Ffor a two-day visit to Ireland.
OL,10,FTrump will hold a courtesy call with
OL,11,FIrish President Catherine Connolly as
OL,12,Fwell as a bilateral meeting with
OL,13,FTaoiseach (Irish Prime Minister)
OL,14,FMicheal Martin.
OL,16,FHe will also attend events at the US
OL,17,FAmbassador to Ireland Ed Walsh's
OL,18,Fresidence in Dublin's Phoenix Park.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
