OL,3,GNEWSATrump to arrive in Ireland for
OL,4,Atwo-day visit
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump will then attend the Amgen Irish
OL,7,FOpen golf tournament which is taking
OL,8,Fplace at the Trump International Golf
OL,9,FLinks and Hotel Doonbeg in County
OL,10,FClare, which he owns.
